Third-party material
--------------------
The following are not owned by the copyright holder, remain under their own
terms, and are credited where they are used:

- data/places/cities.json: place names and coordinates from GeoNames
  (geonames.org), CC BY 4.0, obtained through the all-the-cities package
  (MIT licence).
- The coastlines embedded in prototypes/stratasphere-viewer/index.html:
  Natural Earth (naturalearthdata.com), public domain.
- data/sars-cov-2-lineages/: dates, clade relationships and quoted
  designation notes from Nextstrain (nextstrain/ncov, MIT licence,
  Copyright (c) 2020 Nextstrain) and Pango (cov-lineages/pango-designation,
  CC BY 4.0). Pango's notes are quoted verbatim and credited per node.
- data/unix-family/: release facts from the Unix History Repository by
  D. Spinellis (dspinellis/unix-history-make, Apache License 2.0).
- Facts drawn from the other sources listed in each dataset's SOURCE.md
  (dates, places, names) are not claimed; the compilation of them is.
- three.js and its OrbitControls (MIT licence) are loaded from public CDNs
  and are not part of this repository.

